{"quest_id": 6280, "name": "呪われし王子軍", "description": "洞窟を訪れた王子軍の先遣隊が\n呪われた宝石の欠片を発見するが……。\n\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "大怪盗とピラミッドの秘宝", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920098, "map_no": 5255, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 65, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 22, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2250, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 2250, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 131, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097488, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 201, "master_id": 30652, "global_id": 4271, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2350, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2350, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 100, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097568, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 201, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 30654, "global_id": 4273, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 12}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 4500, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 172, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097504, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 200, "master_id": 30653, "global_id": 4272, "spawn_sec": 32}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9000, "attack": 750, "base_hp": 9000, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 180, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 55, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 157, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2100480, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 200, "master_id": 30651, "global_id": 4270, "spawn_sec": 49}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4800, "attack": 330, "base_hp": 4800, "base_attack": 330, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 550.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097168, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 200, "master_id": 30655, "global_id": 4274, "spawn_sec": 53}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 195, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 195, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097536, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 201, "master_id": 30656, "global_id": 4275, "spawn_sec": 55}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 2500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 191, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104048, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 201, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 30649, "global_id": 4268, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 82}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4500, "attack": 120, "base_hp": 4500, "base_attack": 120, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 25, "attack_interval": 87, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2107312, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 202, "missile_id": 22, "missile": {"speed": 10.0}, "master_id": 30650, "global_id": 4269, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 82}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ったく……お宝が見つかるかもしれねえっつうから\nついてきたってのに、なんでい、このシケた洞くつは？", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "リカルド", "text": "だが、王子たちが探している宝石の欠片は\n魂を糧に所有者を強化する、\n呪われた品だそうじゃないか。", "face": "u205"}, {"name": "リカルド", "text": "まぁ、完璧な俺がそんな宝石ごときの\n呪いにかかるわけはないが――", "face": "u205"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "――うぉッ！　なんだこの宝箱は！？\nすんげえ財宝が入ってそうじゃねえか！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "ロイ", "text": "も、モーティマ殿。そう早まりなさるな。\nそのような怪しい宝箱は、えてして\n開けた途端に呪いが発動するもので――", "face": "u11"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ぐぉおおおッ！　な、なんじゃこりゃあ！？\nお宝を見たら……目の前ガ、真ッ赤ニ……。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "リカルド", "text": "なッ――宝箱を開けてしまったのか！？\n……うッ……身体ガ、言ウコトヲ聞カナイ……ッ！", "face": "u205"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "ウ……グォオオオオオォオオオオオオッッ！！！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "――ッ！　奥へ行った皆さんが\nこちらへ武器を向けて走ってきます！\nまさか、宝石の欠片の呪いに……？", "face": "lbfab4fba6540"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ひとまず応戦しましょう！\n彼らを正気に戻せるかもしれません。", "face": "u114"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ロイ", "text": "ハァッ、ハァッ……め、面目ない……。\n正気を失っていたとはいえ、\n味方に危害を加えようとしてしまうとは……。", "face": "u11"}, {"name": "リカルド", "text": "うぅっ……情けない限りだ。\n呪いに対する警戒は完璧だと思っていたんだが。", "face": "u205"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "はぁ……。\n済んだことを責めても仕方ありませんが、\n軽率な行動は慎んでくださいね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "そうだそうだ！\nったく、これだからトーシローは。", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……モーティマさん、\n貴方が犯人だということはお見通しですよ？", "face": "l855824aac6c8"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "な、なに言ってんだおめえ？\nこの天下の大山賊、モーティマ様が\n呪われた宝石なんぞに手を出すわけが――", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "リカルド", "text": "……と言いながらポケットに入れたそれは\nさっきの宝箱に入っていた宝石の欠片だな？", "face": "u205"}, {"name": "モーティマ", "text": "いででででッ！　わ、わかった、渡す渡す！\n渡すから剣を突きつけねえでくれッ！", "face": "u14"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……モーティマさんの手癖の悪さはともかく、\nバステトを信仰する民たちが有する\n宝石の欠片を集める必要があるのは事実です。", "face": "lbfab4fba6540"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "彼らが呪われた宝石の力を使って\nバステトを復活させてしまわないように、\n呪われた宝石の欠片の収集を急ぎましょう！", "face": "lbfab4fba6540"}]}], "active": true}